zabbix-widget-event-timeline (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Monitoring target and events can be taken from fixed settings or from
    widgets (Tree Navigator / Event Navigator).
  * Events are specified by selecting triggers; with no trigger selected, all
    events of the target hosts are shown.
  * Runtime controls: severity chips, acknowledgement filter, aggregation
    (occurred / continuing), tooltip order, and reset.
  * Total / interval moved below the chart; settings dialog reorganized.

 -- claude <noreply@example.com>  Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

zabbix-widget-event-timeline (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Stacked bar chart of problem events per time bucket by
    severity, for selected hosts / host groups.
  * Automatic bucket width (up to 100 buckets, calendar aligned in the user's
    time zone, weeks start on Monday).
  * Tooltip with per-severity event details (host-grouped or chronological),
    hover emphasis, X axis period lines, Y axis minimum scale, and line/text
    colors (Auto follows the Zabbix theme; custom via picker or hex input).
  * Japanese and English locale support.

 -- claude <noreply@example.com>  Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
